{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Bb]One hundred forty [Ebmaj7]years
[Gm]He watched his fami[Ebmaj7]ly tree
[Bb]Old and full of days
[Ebmaj7]He [Gm]finally found [Ebmaj7]his rest
{end_of_bridge}

